DATA PROVENANCE
---------------
All data shipped or generated here is synthetic. It is produced by the
generator in this repository from fixed seeds. No dataset from any company or
third party is included, none was used to build it, and no personal data of
any kind is present. No detector in this repository was tuned on real data.

Numbers produced on this synthetic population describe the generator, not
anyone's real traffic.

